    .tag-ban-warn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:0 0 12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:var(--sf-r-ctl);background:#0b0b0b;color:#fff;font-size:var(--sf-fs-xs);font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;}
    .tag-ban-warn.tag-rival-warn{background:#a33b2e;} /* Community or Petromin, never both (2026-10-12) */
    .confirm-box .tag-ban-opt{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:var(--sf-fs-sm);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;}
    /* Inputs are appearance:none site-wide and the staff skin draws no checkbox of its own: ask for the native box. */
    .confirm-box .tag-ban-opt input{-webkit-appearance:checkbox;appearance:checkbox;width:16px;height:16px;min-height:0;margin:0;flex:none;accent-color:var(--green);}
    /* ── Community without inline styles (2026-09-28, the move of style="..." into classes, so the
       policy can drop style-src 'unsafe-inline'): the leaderboard and statistics, Accounts (its tag
       manager, filter pills, rows and tag editor), Flagged, Birthdays, Applications and learning to
       ride, Duplicates, all drawn into #tab-community; the account editor (#new-acct-modal); the tag
       grant, flag, message, lesson and merge dialogs (#confirm-modal); the add-to-a-ride dialog
       (#comm-add-modal); the JCC group and group edit dialogs (#jcc-group-modal, #group-edit-modal);
       and a tag chip wherever one is drawn (the account history is #cust-modal). Each rule is scoped
       by the id its markup is drawn under, so it outranks every class rule (the body.view-staff
       layer included) as the inline style did. A value known only at run time rides in data-cssv:
       a tag's colours (--cmy-tbg, --cmy-tbd, --cmy-tfg; --tc on the picker and filter buttons, as
       before), a status's colour (--cmy-st, which the dot inherits), a month's bar (--cmy-h) and the
       top rider's progress (--cmy-w). background:none and transparent written in a template are
       background:transparent none here, and outline:none is outline:medium none: the same values,
