body.ar-skin:not(.view-staff) .vl-panel .run-adult{color:#fff;}
/* Open or Elite: the race's own boxes are drawn in literals (white, Victory Lap's ink); here they go dark, the picked
   one ringed in red, its level in red as the poster's table has it */
