   status badge. Waiting (not checked in yet) white, the waitlist orange, to be reserved fuchsia,
   reserved violet, checked in yellow (on a bike or still needing one), completed green, no-show and
   cancelled red (the owner, 2026-10-07: "i want the pending bookings to be colored white not yellow,
   make the checked in bookings yellow instead"; checked in was blue). Solid colours, not washes: the
   pinned first cell has to mask the columns scrolling under it. ── */
