/* ══ TICKETS IN THEIR EVENT'S COLOURS (the owner, 2026-10-06) ═════════════════════════════════════
   "make all booking cards themed the same way the event card is themed", the whole card: every ticket
   on My Bookings and after booking wears its event-picker card's look in every state (_tkThemeCls:
   tk-th th-jcc | th-comm | th-runher | th-event; National Day keeps its own skin). The night ticket's
   rules in the customer system read .ticket-card:is(.tk-live,.tk-th) and are written in its colours,
   so each theme redefines those colours on the card and gives it the card's background. Outside the
   customer system on purpose: these are the event cards' own inks, like the cards themselves. */
body:not(.view-staff) :is(#tab-myrides,#tab-register) .ticket-card.tk-th.th-jcc{
  --night:#06346F;--night-2:rgba(255,255,255,.08);--night-ink:#fff;--night-ink-2:rgba(255,255,255,.74);
  --night-line:rgba(159,213,238,.24);--neon:#9FD5EE;
  background:var(--jcc-chev) right 18px bottom 12px/74px 20px no-repeat,linear-gradient(112deg,var(--jcc-deep) 0%,var(--jcc-navy) 44%,var(--jcc-blue) 100%) #06346F;
  border:1px solid rgba(14,151,213,.4);color:#fff;}
html[dir="rtl"] body:not(.view-staff) :is(#tab-myrides,#tab-register) .ticket-card.tk-th.th-jcc{
  background:var(--jcc-chev-rtl) left 18px bottom 12px/74px 20px no-repeat,linear-gradient(248deg,var(--jcc-deep) 0%,var(--jcc-navy) 44%,var(--jcc-blue) 100%) #06346F;}
/* the chevrons sit in the card's bottom corner, under the last row of buttons: the card keeps room for them */
body:not(.view-staff) :is(#tab-myrides,#tab-register) .ticket-card.tk-th.th-jcc{padding-bottom:30px;}
body:not(.view-staff) :is(#tab-myrides,#tab-register) .ticket-card.tk-th.th-jcc .ticket-num{font-family:'Chakra Petch','IBM Plex Sans Arabic',sans-serif;}
/* the light cards: ink on white, the event's own accent where the night ticket has its neon */
body:not(.view-staff) :is(#tab-myrides,#tab-register) .ticket-card.tk-th:is(.th-comm,.th-runher,.th-event,.th-petromin,.th-swim){
