/* The special needs tag (2026-10-23): a figure in a wheelchair, white on orange (the owner, 2026-10-23; it was blue) - on its tag chip (.tag-svg) and after
   a holder's name wherever staff meet the booking (.sn-mk, _snChip). */
.sn-mk{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;margin-inline-start:6px;width:20px;height:18px;background:#e8590c;color:#fff;border-radius:var(--sf-r-xs);vertical-align:middle;}
/* The blacklist tag (2026-11-09): its mark, the white mark struck through on black, after a holder's name wherever staff
   meet the booking (.blk-mk, _blkChip); a staff signal only. The light edge keeps it on a dark staff screen. */
.blk-mk{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;margin-inline-start:6px;width:20px;height:18px;background:#0b0b0b;color:#fff;border-radius:var(--sf-r-xs);vertical-align:middle;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.35);}
