/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   DEFE 5KM RUN (the owner, 2026-10-18) - Defe's breast-cancer 5 km race, a date inside MicroMobility
   Experiences. Defe's own pink: the ribbon woven into دفء (assets/defe-logo.svg) in rose, berry for
   ink and actions, a blush wash. The date card, the flow from the runner step on (body.defe5k), the
   race box, the "registered for the race?" question, the ticket, staff's chips and the badge.
   ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
:root{--df-rose:#D782A0;--df-berry:#A22B63;--df-berry-dk:#861F50;--df-ink:#3B1328;--df-wash:215,130,160;}
.ev-defe5k{--ev:#A22B63;--ev-rgb:162,43,99;}
