   Sessions list as an agenda. Staff only. ══ */
/* the mark: what you do on it (a bike, a wave, a runner, a drop), in the kind's own colour (ev-* sets --ev) on a wash of it */
body.view-staff .smk{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:var(--sf-r-ctl);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ev,var(--muted)) 14%,transparent);color:var(--ev,var(--muted));}
