/* ══ THE STORE AND PAYMENTS (2026-11-10, migration 20261110150000) ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
   Store (#tab-store: orders, products) and Payments (#tab-payments: online payments, refunds owed, settings), the
   order's sheet (#sto-modal), the product editor (#sto-pe) and the refund dialog (#pay-rf), each a host of its own with
   the confirm dialog's chrome; "Paid online" and "Paying now" on the desk's pay pills and pay menu. */
